#: .\apps\project\specific\documents\certificates\admin.py:472
msgid ""
"1) Upload the ORIGINAL PDF without codes. 2) Pick the stamp layout (or leave "
"it empty for the default one). 3) Save. 4) Run the action “Certify” from the "
"list view."
